`test_a_missing_ots_proof_for_a_range_head_is_caught` still works. In that test,
it uses stubs:
- `check_sigstore` returns `(1, range_predicate(chain, 1, 2), "c0ffee")` - the 
first value (1) is the integrated_time
- `check_ots` returns `None` - meaning pending

